boost our emotional connection with them? What do we instruct people to vividly imagine a scene in which they have to help another person? Somebody's fallen off their motorcycle by the side of the road, and you're about to get out. And that person is either an in-group member, a political partisan or an out-party person. And what we found was that when we told people

