00:44:07.000 --> 00:44:33.000
just how vividly they said they were able to simulate it, was related to how much more empathy they had. So people who told us, I simulated, but I had trouble putting it in my mind's eye. Those folks had lower empathy ratings for in-group and out-group members, than those folks who said, no, I could see it. I could see it clear as day in my head, and that really moved the needle for them. So we've talked a lot about how we can recognize moments when we are getting swept up by our

