groups and what we can do about it. And of course, it's one thing to have insights about what's happening and what to do, and another thing to actually put those insights into practice. I want you to tell me about a time when you once experienced a shift in regard to how you thought about an office mate. On first encounter, you felt like you had nothing in common with her. Can you tell me why, Mina? Yes.

