who she was as a person essentially subsumed your stereotypes of who she was at a very broad level. That's right. I had this model in my head and she just wasn't anything like that model. And the more time that I spent with her, the more I realized just how wrong that model was. And have you I spent with her, the more I realized just how wrong that model was. And have you stayed friends with her? Is she still someone you were in touch with? Is she gone in touch tomorrow? Would you be glad to hear from her? Oh, I would drop everything to do anything she asked me to.

